{"symbol":"IP.MI","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:22:00Z","info":{"address1":"Via Enrico Fermi 25","city":"Sant'ilario D'enza","state":"RE","zip":"42049","country":"Italy","phone":"39 05 22 90 43 33","fax":"39 05 22 90 44 44","website":"https://www.interpumpgroup.it","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","industryKey":"specialty-industrial-machinery","industryDisp":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Interpump Group S.p.A., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacturing and selling of high-pressure pumps in Italy, rest of Europe, North America, the Far East and the Pacific Area, and internationally. The company is involved in the design and distribution of volumetric pumps; production, sale, and distribution of pressure systems and pumps; production of mechanical sifters; production and sale of equipment for the food processing, chemicals, cosmetics, and pharmaceuticals industries; galvanic treatment of metals; and sale of centrifugal separators. It also engages in drawing, shearing, and pressing sheet metal; design, production, and sale of mechanized milking systems; production and sale of power take-offs, hydraulic pumps, hydraulic cylinders, valves, rotary unions, hydraulic hoses, and fittings, as well as rubber mixtures, rigid and flexible hydraulic lines, and directional controls; sale of ancillary products for industrial vehicles; surface treatments; and smelting of ferrous metals, cast iron, and aluminum. In addition, the company is involved in the production and sale of power transmission systems, planetary gears, ratiomotors, and drive wheels; and the design, production, and sale of piping systems. Further, it offers water-jetting and hydraulics-related components, as well as flanges, oil tanks, gears, orbital motors, steering system, cylinder, mixers, plunger pumps, special pumps, cleaning systems, and valves and tanks. Interpump Group S.p.A. was founded in 1977 and is based in Sant'ilario D'enza, Italy.","fullTimeEmployees":9749,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Fulvio  Montipo","age":81,"title":"Executive President of the Board","yearBorn":1944,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":31798200},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Fabio  Marasi","title":"CEO & Executive Director","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":2614400},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Mauro  Barani","title":"Group Chief Financial Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Federico  Pavesi","title":"Head of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Giacomo  Leo","title":"ESG Executive Director & Group Legal Counsel","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Giovanni  Poletti","title":"Chief Reporting Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":9,"boardRisk":6,"compensationRisk":6,"shareHolderRightsRisk":1,"overallRisk":5,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":38.5,"open":38.58,"dayLow":38.4,"dayHigh":39.3,"regularMarketPreviousClose":38.5,"regularMarketOpen":38.58,"regularMarketDayLow":38.4,"regularMarketDayHigh":39.3,"dividendRate":0.35,"dividendYield":0.91,"exDividendDate":1779062400,"payoutRatio":0.1655,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":0.72,"beta":1.248,"trailingPE":19.33,"forwardPE":16.2162,"volume":107648,"regularMarketVolume":107648,"averageVolume":153322,"averageVolume10days":197530,"averageDailyVolume10Day":197530,"bid":38.58,"ask":38.68,"bidSize":0,"askSize":0,"marketCap":4062941952,"nonDilutedMarketCap":4046126969,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":30.1,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":51.3,"allTimeHigh":69.1,"allTimeLow":1.9,"fulldayPrice":38.66,"fulldayChange":0.16,"fulldayChangePercent":0.415584,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.91987,"fiftyDayAvera